==============================================================================
CONTROL: coherence vs cardinality.  Three families at MATCHED cardinality:
   (a) coherent block tower (Riesz)   (b) consecutive single block
   (c) GENUINE Sidon set (Mian-Chowla): minimal additive structure = decorrelated
   NOTE: random-integers-in-a-small-box are NOT incoherent -- by pigeonhole they
   are dense in differences (high additive energy), so they score HIGH.  A real
   incoherence control must be Sidon (all pairwise sums distinct).
==============================================================================
  card | tower(blocks) sup|wD|  | consec sup|wD| | SIDON sup|wD|   (Sidon set)
     6  |    1.4895          |    0.7327      |   0.3434   [0, 1, 3, 7, 12, 20]
     9  |    3.2943          |    0.9342      |   3.6535   [0, 1, 3, 7, 12, 20, 30, 44, 65]
    12  |    4.6126          |    0.7878      |   9.7378   [0, 1, 3, 7, 12, 20, 30, 44, 65, 80, 96, 122]
  READING: the block tower is NOT uniquely worst. Both wide towers and wide
  Sidon sets score high; the narrow consec block is the MINIMIZER. => the driver
  is SPREAD / #distinct-scales, reached by coherent repetition OR by spreading.

==============================================================================
THE TRADE-OFF: why large sup|wD| is NOT a counterexample (Phi anti-correlates)
   p0(E')=meas{all 7 sectors hit};  p1=meas{exactly one inner sector missed};
   plateau Plat = p0 + p1/7 (frozen-phase limit).  cap_9 = 1979/4004 ~ 0.4943.
==============================================================================
  family(card9)   span   p0(E')    p1-meas   Plat=p0+p1/7   sup|wD|   regime
  consec-9           8   0.4162    0.2221    0.4479        0.934   BINDING (near cap, small Delta)
  tower-9(3blk)     62   0.2233    0.2656    0.2613        3.294   SLACK (small Plat, large Delta)
  sidon-9           65   0.0366    0.3935    0.0928        3.654   SLACK (small Plat, large Delta)
  => sup|wD| is LARGE exactly where Plat is SMALL. p0(full)=Plat+Delta stays < cap
     in every regime. The discrepancy and the plateau are DUAL; neither alone is
     a counterexample. This is the Phi-Delta trade-off (repo HYP-2779/kps-S23).

