    E = B (+) 30*B,  B={0,1,2};   \hat 1_E(xi) =?= \hat 1_B(xi) * \hat 1_B(30 xi)
==============================================================================
    max_xi | \hat 1_E(xi) - \hat 1_B(xi)\hat 1_B(30 xi) | over 49 probes = 5.53e-14
    => E IS an exact 2-fold Riesz product (B dilated by 1 and by 30).
       n-block tower = B (+) 30*{0..n-1}; deeper nesting B(+)30B(+)900B = 3-fold, etc.

